        "text": "∃ C > 0, ∀ lam ≤ 1/120, ∀ amp eta y, |eta| ≤ 1 → |correctionJet c amp k eta y| ≤ C * exp (-(1/(4*lam))) * (1 + |amp eta|) ∧ ∀ amp', HasDerivAt amp amp' eta → |deriv (fun t => correctionJet c amp k t y) eta| ≤ C * exp (-(1/(4*lam))) * (1 + |amp'|)  — for every radial jet order k"
